# TimeBank Project Context

TimeBank (时间银行) is a middle-school volunteer service recording system. Service hours → "time coins" (non-financial, never call them tokens/currency).

## Current State (2026-08-04)

**Backend (B0–B6 work items done, deployed, live on test server):**
- B0 Foundation, B1 Identity, B2 Base Data: `✅`
- B3 Core Loop (records, review, ledger, progress): all 13 work items `✅`
- B4 Projects & Proposals: all 12 work items `✅`
- B5 Admin Surface: all 12 work items `✅`
- B6 Hardening: most items done; load test (B6.10) blocked on staging infra
- B7 Database Ops: mostly blocked on infrastructure
- B3F Cloud File Storage: not started (local-disk adapter in use)

**Frontend:** React SPA complete, reads from in-memory mocks via `api.*` client. No real HTTP calls yet.

**Integration (I0–I3): ALL `—` not started — this is the next focus.**

## What Comes Next

The **integration phases** (I0 → I1 → I2 → I3) wire the finished frontend to the finished backend:

1. **I0 Contract Prep** — lift types, build HTTP transport, fix divergences, per-domain toggle
2. **I1 Read Path** — swap 20+ read calls from mock to real backend, domain by domain
3. **I2 Write Path** — wire every mutation (currently just `toast.success()` stubs)
4. **I3 Acceptance** — evidence upload, localization, E2E scenarios, UAT

Also remaining backend-side:
- Open exit criteria on B3–B5 phases (frontend demos, query-count/EXPLAIN tests)
- B3F cloud file storage migration
- B7 infrastructure provisioning (blocked externally)

